From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 123/123] PC5: five Wine fixes, Zink patches and disk blocks in the
 alive line (Wine patches 0957, 0966 to 0969)

- 0957: every file is the player's, so a game can write the files it makes (Necesse's saves).
- 0966: the video memory kept within 32 bits (Leo Lobato's 0998).
- 0967: ProcessCommandLineInformation answered (after Mihawk OS 2427).
- 0968: GetModuleHandle of an API set finds its host loaded from the game's folder (Company of Heroes 3).
- 0969: a thread's own CPU time, and the processor it runs on (after Mihawk OS 2457).
- tools/build_mesa_zink.sh --patches DIR builds Zink with patches on a copy of the pinned source.
- The alive line gives the file system blocks read and written so far.
